users to block emails from those domains.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="234076">Blocked Top-Level Domain List</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="qut-GT"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1906848">Cholajil kib'i' q'alajisab'al e q'atetalik pa unimaqil</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GTM</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10268_169412_1596421"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To do over again.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="169412">redo</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="qut-GT"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1596421">ukamulixik</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GTM</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10275_6075_1906419"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of changing the values in cells to see how those changes affect the outcome of formulas on a worksheet. For example, varying the interest rate that is used in an amortization table to determine the amount of the payments.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="6075">what-if analysis</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="qut-GT"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1906419">uchomaxik what-if</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GTM</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10275_6076_1906419"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of changing the values in cells to see how those changes affect the outcome of formulas on a worksheet. For example, varying the interest rate that is used in an amortization table to determine the amount of the payments.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="6076">"what-if" evaluation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="qut-GT"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1906419">uchomaxik what-if</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GTM</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10276_232855_2314975"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An option that displays the Web page in a Web browser.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="232855">Web Page Preview</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="qut-GT"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2314975">Nab'e rilik pa uxaq web'</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GTM</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10278_142089_2314802"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A technique in which you filter records in a form, datasheet, or data access page to retrieve only those records that don't contain the selected value.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp