alized, individually addressed email to the recipients in the specified list.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="186196">E-mail Merge</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="qut-GT"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1906742">Uxolonem rech suk'umanem pa taqoqxa'n</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GTM</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13089_102926_2314906"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A process of copying content and/or configuration settings from one location, generally a server node, to another to ensure synchronization or fault tolerance.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="102926">replication</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="qut-GT"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2314906">Kamulinem</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GTM</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13099_375945_1807073"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A typographical unit of measure that is equal to one sixth of an inch.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="375945">pica</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="qut-GT"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1807073">pica</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GTM</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1310_169918_1781905"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The unique, 25-character code on a prepaid card that adds computer use time to your prepaid computer or that pays for your subscription.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="169918">prepaid card number</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="qut-GT"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1781905">retal chajinem</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GTM</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1310_1736123_1781905"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The unique, 25-character code on a prepaid card that adds computer use time to your prepaid computer or that pays for your subscription.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1736123">token</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="qut-GT"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1781905">retal chajinem</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GTM</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1310_214131_1781905"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The unique, 25-character code on a prepaid card that adds computer use time to your prepaid computer or that pays for your subscription.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="214131">prepaid card code</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="gr