mmaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1686_90627_1596339"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A distinct chunk of text that is indicated by formatting such as indentation, numbering, or a new line.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="90627">paragraph</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="qut-GT"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1596339">woktzijonem</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GTM</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1688_74871_1571011"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In word processing, a string of characters displayed or printed in a single horizontal row.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="74871">line</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="qut-GT"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1571011">juch'ub'al</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GTM</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16907_627846_1596528"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The date when a project or task is scheduled to begin.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="627846">begin date</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="qut-GT"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1596528">uq'ijal umajik</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GTM</termNote><termNote type="p