lps increase input speed and reduce effort by providing users with word completion and next word prediction alternates as the user is writing/typing.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="766591">text prediction</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="qut-GT"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1773055">uchuq'ab'il woktzij</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GTM</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21091_766598_1772992"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An extension of the conventional touch input feature to allow multiple fingers touching the computer or device screen at the same time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="766598">multi-touch input</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="qut-GT"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1772992">rokib'al k'iwach t'inq'ab'</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GTM</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21091_766861_1772992"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An extension of the conventional touch input feature to allow multiple fingers touching the computer or device screen at the same time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="766861">multi-touch gesture</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="qut-GT"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1772992">rokib'al k'iwa