 transforms a picture stored in one file format to another format so that it can be displayed in a specific graphics program.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="142836">graphic filter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="qut-GT"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2314812">chayub'al k'utwachib'al</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GTM</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3065_142837_2314812"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A program that transforms a picture stored in one file format to another format so that it can be displayed in a specific graphics program.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="142837">graphics filter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="qut-GT"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2314812">chayub'al k'utwachib'al</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GTM</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3068_79974_2741691"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A flag that marks a message for follow up or with a request for someone else.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="79974">message flag</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="qut-GT"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2741691">retwokaj rech oqxa'n</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GTM</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote