 to Windows devices using biometric authentication or a PIN.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2227614">Hello</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="qut-GT"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2234494">Windows Hello</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GTM</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38439_2227183_2234496"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature in Windows that allows a person to connect remotely to someone else's computer to help fix a problem.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2227183">Windows Remote Assistance</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="qut-GT"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2234496">Najtarisam tob'anem Windows</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GTM</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38440_2227688_2234498"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The user's video library title, displayed in the " Quick links" section, for movies and TV shows.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2227688">Your movies &amp; TV</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="qut-GT"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2234498">Taq asilob'k'utwachinem chi'l q'axwachib'al</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GTM</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</te