 feature that allows users to change letter, word, line, and column spacing to reduce visual crowding.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2428470">Text Spacing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="qut-GT"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2431969">uxo'l woktz'ib'</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GTM</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42829_2428723_2431972"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The task pane (in Office and other programs) where users can view a translation of other content and control the settings for that translation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2428723">Translator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="qut-GT"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2431972">Q'axel tzij</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GTM</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42832_2429234_2433770"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Word feature that supports the use of LaTeX math equations.​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2429234">LaTeX Equations</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="qut-GT"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2433770">LaTeX Taq ub'ek'iyalil</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GTM</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</t