sers to override the Automatic Punctuation mode so that they can use voice commands (such as comma and period) to create punctuation in their document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2505358">Manual Punctuation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="qut-GT"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2506042">Manual Punctuation</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GTM</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4459_148656_1906693"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The slide that stores information about the design template applied, including font styles, placeholder sizes and positions, background design, and color schemes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="148656">slide master</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="qut-GT"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1906693">wokk'utub'al k'amalb'e</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GTM</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44608_2573054_2578998"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The section of the expanded view of the profile card that contains LinkedIn profile information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2573054">LinkedIn profile in Microsoft</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="qut-GT"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2578998">cholk'a