s that uses add-in programs, or gadgets, to extend information from your computer onto secondary displays.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="235051">Windows SideShow</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="qut-GT"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1596505">SideShow</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GTM</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4860_235051_1773538"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature in Windows that uses add-in programs, or gadgets, to extend information from your computer onto secondary displays.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="235051">Windows SideShow</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="qut-GT"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1773538">Windows SideShow</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GTM</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4860_312519_1596505"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature in Windows that uses add-in programs, or gadgets, to extend information from your computer onto secondary displays.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="312519">SideShow</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="qut-GT"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1596505">SideShow</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GTM</termNote><termNote type="partOfS