 off. When the computer is switched back on, the desktop is restored exactly as it was.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="61276">hibernate</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="qut-GT"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1596187">uxlanisaxik</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GTM</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9543_415057_1906943"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A member of a dimension whose value is calculated at run time by using an expression. Calculated member values can be derived from the values of other members.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="415057">calculated member</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="qut-GT"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1906943">raqanib'al etatalik</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">GTM</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9552_266832_1906890"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A secondary data source that is accessible to users who fill out forms offline. When a user is online, data from the data source is stored on the user’s computer so that it can appear in controls when the form is offline.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="266832">offline data source</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="qut-GT"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1906890"